Copyright 2026 ProtoForge contributors

This project is designed to work downstream of, and uses terminology from:

- hello_js_reverse_skill (https://github.com/WhiteNightShadow/hello_js_reverse_skill),
  Apache License 2.0. The success levels S0-S4, delivery routes R0-R6, result
  classes (not_sent / transport_error / rejected / accepted / target_ok) and the
  "chain A-K" problem routing referenced in SKILL.md and references/ are defined there.
- camoufox-reverse-mcp (https://github.com/WhiteNightShadow/camoufox-reverse-mcp),
  MIT License. `pf import` reads the JSON format produced by its
  `export_network_capture` tool (schema_version 1).

No source code from either project is included in this repository.
